event: tool_result
data: {"content":"pando_setup — inspect and steer this Pando instance.\n\nCommands:\n  help       List the commands, or show the usage of one of them\n  config     Read the active configuration (read-only, secrets masked)\n  providers  List the configured provider accounts and their credential state\n  models     List selectable models with their canonical id (e.g. copilot.gpt-5.4)\n  model      Show the model this session runs on, or switch it\n  lsp        List the language servers: installed, installable by Pando, or manual\n  projects   List the projects registered in this Pando instance's project registry\n  session    Show this session's token usage, cost and active modes\n  commands   List the slash commands, marking the ones this tool can activate\n  run        Activate a slash command for this session\n  telemetry  Show or change remote telemetry (opt-in diagnostics shipped to Better Stack)\n  decision-model Show, change, test or list models of the shared decision model (System One router)\n  sandbox    Show the host command sandbox status (read-only)\n\nPass args=\"--help\" to any command for its own usage.\n","is_error":false,"kind":"other","locations":null,"name":"pando_setup","raw_output":{"output":"pando_setup — inspect and steer this Pando instance.\n\nCommands:\n  help       List the commands, or show the usage of one of them\n  config     Read the active configuration (read-only, secrets masked)\n  providers  List the configured provider accounts and their credential state\n  models     List selectable models with their canonical id (e.g. copilot.gpt-5.4)\n  model      Show the model this session runs on, or switch it\n  lsp        List the language servers: installed, installable by Pando, or manual\n  projects   List the projects registered in this Pando instance's project registry\n  session    Show this session's token usage, cost and active modes\n  commands   List the slash commands, marking the ones this tool can activate\n  run        Activate a slash command for this session\n  telemetry  Show or change remote telemetry (opt-in diagnostics shipped to Better Stack)\n  decision-model Show, change, test or list models of the shared decision model (System One router)\n  sandbox    Show the host command sandbox status (read-only)\n\nPass args=\"--help\" to any command for its own usage.\n"},"status":"completed","title":"pando_setup","tool_call_id":"call_pLj2v9MP4NASZw1XzOx44E7g"}

